// The two "unprotected" varps hold the counters that are meant to be lost on death. Losing them to
// a LOGOUT is a different thing and only the first is intended, so they are perm as well. And they
// are protect=no, which is what the name means: they are the ones a monster's own [ai_queue] can
// write (the Anger room's rage, the Confusion illusions' hit counts) without p_finduid.
